---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Lab" description="A register for tests, prototypes and technical investigations.">
  <header class="page-intro"><div class="shell page-intro-grid"><div><span class="record-number">LAB / EXPERIMENTS</span><h1>TESTS &amp;<br />PROOFS</h1></div><p>A future register for small experiments, including work that fails, pauses or is archived.</p></div></header>
  <div class="shell empty-state"><span class="eyebrow">REGISTER STATE / EMPTY</span><h2>No experiment is being presented as complete.</h2><p>The system accepts TEST, PROVEN, FAILED, PAUSED and ARCHIVED records when real material is ready.</p></div>
</BaseLayout>
